    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2 May 2026</p>
    <p>
      This site doesn't collect personal data. There's no analytics tracking, no
      cookies for advertising, and no third-party scripts that profile visitors.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you email me at
      <a href="mailto:paulo@myneatflow.com">paulo@myneatflow.com</a>, I keep that
      email to reply. I don't share it.
    </p>
    <p>
      For questions about this policy, email
      <a href="mailto:paulo@myneatflow.com">paulo@myneatflow.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
